{
  "_id": "whbHuntHellbrn01",
  "folder": "whbfolderHntMn01",
  "name": "地狱之子 Hellborn",
  "type": "npc",
  "img": "modules/wang-pf2e-homebrew/assets/hunt/hellborn.png",
  "items": [
    {
      "_id": "whbHlbClaw000001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg",
      "name": "熔岩爪",
      "sort": 100000,
      "type": "melee",
      "system": {
        "action": { "value": "" },
        "attackEffects": { "custom": "", "value": [] },
        "bonus": { "value": 14 },
        "damageRolls": {
          "whbHlbDmgClawS01": {
            "damage": "2d8+6",
            "damageType": "slashing"
          },
          "whbHlbDmgClawF01": {
            "damage": "1d8",
            "damageType": "fire"
          }
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>白骨巨爪自胸腔熔岩中探出。触及 10 尺。命中时目标须尝试 @Check[reflex|dc:21|traits:fire]{反射 DC 21}；失败则获得 @UUID[Compendium.wang-pf2e-homebrew.homebrew-items.Item.whbHuntBurnFx001]{猎杀灼烬} 1 层（已有则 +1）。</p>\n<p>近战贴脸极危险——它更常先掷火球再冲上来熔溅。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — Wild Target",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "range": null,
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": { "value": ["reach-10", "fire"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbHlbBall000001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg",
      "name": "熔岩火球（单发）",
      "sort": 200000,
      "type": "melee",
      "system": {
        "action": { "value": "" },
        "attackEffects": { "custom": "", "value": [] },
        "bonus": { "value": 14 },
        "damageRolls": {
          "whbHlbDmgBall001": {
            "damage": "2d8+4",
            "damageType": "fire"
          }
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>投出一枚炸裂的熔岩球。射程 <strong>60 尺</strong>。命中时目标获得 @UUID[Compendium.wang-pf2e-homebrew.homebrew-items.Item.whbHuntBurnFx001]{猎杀灼烬} 1 层（已有则 +1），并点燃落点 5 尺内短暂火场（进入或在其中开始回合受 @Damage[1d6[fire]]，持续 1 分钟或被扑灭）。</p>\n<p><strong>引燃弹药：</strong>若火球轨迹或落点触及已点燃引线的爆炸物（投掷中、手中或地上），该爆炸物立刻引爆（GM 裁定伤害归属）。</p>\n<p>侧移躲避比硬挡更安全；更完整的连射见「熔岩连射」。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — Wild Target",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "range": 60,
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": { "value": ["fire", "propulsive"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbHlbVolley0001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp",
      "name": "熔岩连射",
      "sort": 600000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "action" },
        "actions": { "value": 2 },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>对 60 尺内可见生物（可分摊目标）连续投出熔岩火球。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>常态：</strong>投出 <strong>3</strong> 枚；</li>\n<li><strong>半血以下</strong>（当前 HP ≤ 一半）：改为 <strong>4</strong> 枚。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>每枚火球：目标受到 @Damage[2d8[fire]] 火焰伤害，并尝试 @Check[reflex|basic|dc:21|traits:fire]{基础反射豁免 DC 21}。失败则获得 @UUID[Compendium.wang-pf2e-homebrew.homebrew-items.Item.whbHuntBurnFx001]{猎杀灼烬} 1 层（已有则 +1）；大失败再额外 +1 层。每枚火球落点点燃 5 尺短暂火场（同「熔岩火球」）。</p>\n<p>这是它的招牌：快速啃掉生命块，让猎人更容易死于后续怪物与敌方猎人。</p>\n<p><em>GM：</em>可用「熔岩火球（单发）」打击代替逐枚结算攻击加值；豁免版更贴近原作「侧移躲开」。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — Wild Target",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": { "value": ["fire"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbHlbSplash0001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp",
      "name": "近身熔溅",
      "sort": 610000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "action" },
        "actions": { "value": 1 },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>要求</strong> 至少一名敌人与你相邻或处于触及内</p>\n<p>胸腔与口腔喷溅熔岩，覆盖 @Template[type:cone|distance:15]{15 尺锥形}（或以自身为中心的 @Template[type:burst|distance:5]{5 尺爆发}，择一）。区内每个生物受到 @Damage[3d8[fire]] 火焰伤害，并尝试 @Check[reflex|basic|dc:21|traits:fire]{基础反射豁免 DC 21}。失败则获得 @UUID[Compendium.wang-pf2e-homebrew.homebrew-items.Item.whbHuntBurnFx001]{猎杀灼烬} 1 层（已有则 +1）。</p>\n<p>近战几乎不可能：贴脸就会被熔溅烤穿。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — Wild Target",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": { "value": ["fire"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbHlbBarrage001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/ThreeActions.webp",
      "name": "地狱火齐射",
      "sort": 620000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "action" },
        "actions": { "value": 3 },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Stride（至少移动 10 尺冲向猎物），然后向空中甩出六枚火球，砸落在自身周围中距环带。</p>\n<p>以你为中心产生 @Template[type:burst|distance:20]{20 尺爆发}（可选：排除你所占空间与邻接 5 尺，形成「脚下安全、外圈落地」）。区内每个生物受到 @Damage[2d8[fire]] 火焰伤害，并尝试 @Check[reflex|basic|dc:21|traits:fire]{基础反射豁免 DC 21}。失败则获得 @UUID[Compendium.wang-pf2e-homebrew.homebrew-items.Item.whbHuntBurnFx001]{猎杀灼烬} 1 层并点燃所在格短暂火场。</p>\n<p>典型节奏：连射 → 冲锋齐射 → 再连射。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — Wild Target",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": { "value": ["fire", "move"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbHlbDodge00001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp",
      "name": "焦壳侧闪",
      "sort": 700000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "reaction" },
        "actions": { "value": null },
        "category": "defensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 你成为一次远程打击的目标，且攻击者距你至少 15 尺</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 对这次打击的 AC 获得 +2 环境加值。若攻击因此未击中，你可 Step 5 尺。</p>\n<p>研究者笔记：它能轻松躲开较慢的投射物；步枪与速射更稳。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — Wild Target",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": { "value": [] }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbHlbRoar000001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/FreeAction.webp",
      "name": "余震嘶吼",
      "sort": 520000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "free" },
        "actions": { "value": null },
        "category": "interaction",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 你首次在本场遭遇中受到伤害，或开始使用「熔岩连射」</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 发出可传遍峡谷的嘶吼。地震仪狂跳：30 尺内未聋的生物须尝试 @Check[fortitude|dc:20]{强韧 DC 20}，失败则耳鸣 1 轮（听觉检定 −2）。</p>\n<p><em>GM：</em>此吼声会吸引其他猎人与游荡怪物（把下一波遭遇提前 1d4 轮，或让远处队伍感知到交战）。拖得越久，第三方介入风险越高。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — Wild Target",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": { "value": ["auditory", "sonic"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbHlbHeatAura01",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "name": "硫磺炽体",
      "sort": 500000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "passive" },
        "actions": { "value": null },
        "category": "defensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>巨型焚化者：体型更大，胸腔喷涌熔岩，周身硫磺刺鼻。对火焰伤害<strong>免疫</strong>；对寒冷具有弱点。</p>\n<p>10 尺内温度计会爆裂：在你 10 尺内开始回合的生物若未获得火焰抗性，受到 @Damage[1d4[fire]]（可忽略，用于营造氛围）。黑暗中它自身就是火光。</p>\n<p>枪弹与爆炸物有效；已点燃的炸药触及火球会提前引爆——勿在它面前点着引线硬丢。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — Wild Target",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": { "value": ["aura", "fire"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbHlbBanis00001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "name": "跪地驱逐",
      "sort": 510000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "passive" },
        "actions": { "value": null },
        "category": "interaction",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>降至 0 HP 时双膝跪地，随即被<strong>立刻驱逐</strong>（无需额外驱逐仪式）。击杀队伍可拾取赏金令牌（建议授予 @UUID[Compendium.wang-pf2e-homebrew.homebrew-items.Item.whbHuntBountyTk1]{赏金令牌} 或恢复生命块，由 GM 按局规则）。</p>\n<p>它总会留下一道随机「燃烧系」特性残渣（除死里逃生/死而复生类外，GM 自表抽取）。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — Wild Target",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": { "value": [] }
      }
    }
